id:                     E3378
title: 能力探测的路径基准应随工作目录切换
trigger_tool: perl|make|test
phase: testing
error_signature: symlink capability probe skipped despite independent symlink test passing; duplicated relative fixture prefix after chdir
severity:               2
category:               detection, portability, testing, filesystem
match_keywords: chdir, relative fixture path, capability probe, false negative, symlink, ENOENT, skipped assertions, current working directory
root_cause: 能力探测在chdir进入夹具后仍拼接旧的相对夹具前缀，使实际路径重复；创建失败被错误归为平台不支持。必须先校验探测路径的坐标基准，再解释errno或启用能力分支。
affected_scope: 切换工作目录后以相对路径探测文件系统能力的构建系统和测试夹具
verification_cmd: make -j1 test TEST_VERBOSE=1; preserve all original registered files and actual TAP
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: validate-probe-coordinate-before-capability-classification
rec_description: 绑定实际cwd、目录切换与路径构造；以同一文件系统中独立原始正例检验能力假说；只将探测文件定位到当前夹具内，保留所有计划、断言和原守卫，再用完整真实入口核对跳过断言确实恢复执行。不要通过放宽断言、全局改目录权限或一概吞掉OSError消除失败。
rec_command: Compare actual cwd and original independent positive link tests; fix only the fixture-relative probe path
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Keep every assertion and original capability guard; correct the path within current fixture and require full applicable original tests with exact dispositions.
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/E2026101615363-draft-A139.md
last_updated: 2026-10-16
source_event: 本轮保留平台 build108278/request121438 在原始 make test 阶段达到3600秒的真实超时。候选配方先应用构建环境，再固定声明的运行时和unzip路径；原始入口保持 make -j1 test TEST_VERBOSE=1，关闭自动化stdin，实时保留完整stdout/stderr，并设置300秒执行上限及本任务进程组收敛。新正式事务 perl-archive-zip-1.68-official-20261016-r935 两次真实create各完成原28项清单：26适用程序911/911断言、断言级跳过0；仅已确认的两项原平台守卫不适用，均不计通过。消费者4/4、Harmony1/1、15回执30WAL、唯一launch、own0及release/postrelease均已独立核验。两次实际执行记录均rc0、未超时、输出摘要一致，结束时本任务测试进程组不存在。观察SHA256 1c91e24310965c54375e55c01a1ad64718b95a744af91fd606fbc54f371bf29f；W3日志SHA256 41078c15ce6677ff3e6ade35f22dbcc3776ea17333bcbe20ac6a41be197da641。新提交的完整平台CI和Review继续独立验收。
